WEBVTT

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.270
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.400
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.150
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:11.990
Shining Finger

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.860
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:20.700
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:26.370
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:32.630
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.050
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:48.400
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.690
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:55.190
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:58.280
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:02.290
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:04.040
Bright you now

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:08.540
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:10.880
Shining Finger

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:12.550
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:29.980
Space Colony
Neo Mexico

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:33.020
That's right.

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:35.190
The ocean you see out there...

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:38.280
...is the water off of Neo Mexico,
where I used to live.

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:39.700
Wow!

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:40.910
It's beautiful.

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:41.820
But, no.

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:45.240
Of course it looks pretty from here.

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:49.420
But I hear you can't catch fish
in those waters anymore.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:50.750
Did the ocean die?

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:53.250
It's not dead.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:55.960
The ocean has the strength
to keep on living.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:59.300
I'm sure by the time you grow up...

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:02.970
...the ocean will have returned
to its beautiful and bountiful self.

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:05.010
I'd love to go there.

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:06.930
Me, too. It's decided!

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:08.390
When I grow up...

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:11.490
...I'll be a fisherman on that ocean,
just like Grandpa was!

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:13.820
Gina. I'm gonna take you with me.

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:16.940
Yeah?
You'll really take me with you?

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:19.070
You bet I will!

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:22.720
I promise you when we grow up...

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:25.740
...we'll go back to the
Earth's ocean. Both of us.

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:26.830
Yeah!

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:28.580
Now...

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:32.080
...Gina and Chico,
so fascinated by the sea...

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:34.140
...eventually grew up.

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:39.170
Will these two make their way
to the ocean they dream of?

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:42.680
Meanwhile, Domon Kasshu
pursues Gundam Fights on Earth...

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:45.850
...to find his brother Kyoji
and the Devil Gundam.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:49.100
Domon is the key to
the little boy's dreams.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:52.730
Neo Mexico
Tequila Gundam

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.730
Today's opponent is Neo Mexico's
Tequila Gundam!

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.690
And now!

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:59.240
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:05.200
Prepare to Fight! Desperate Fugitive

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:03.630
Prepare to Fight! Desperate Fugitive

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:19.130
This is Bunny.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:21.510
I'm hot on the heels of
Gundam Fighter Domon Kasshu.

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:23.550
All right, don't do anything crazy.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:26.140
I'll be fine.
You can count on Bunny.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:29.640
Old man.
Have you seen this man before?

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:32.350
No.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:36.110
I've been told that a Gundam
Fighter lives around here.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.110
Don't know about that.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.150
I see.
I guess I'll ask around.

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:42.450
Don't even bother.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:43.150
What do you mean?

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:46.990
This country is strict
on immigration.

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:50.830
People stay out of trouble by
not getting involved with strangers.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:54.290
You stay here too long and
you'll wear out your welcome.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.590
Whatever...

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:07.050
Are you looking for someone?

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:12.310
What's with you?!

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.610
Hey, hey, wait a minute...

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:20.840
Where's Domon Kasshu?

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.570
The Gundam Fighter escaped?

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:27.530
A Gundam Fighter who should be
fighting for his nation has fled.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:31.040
It's a rebellious act
against the government.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:35.250
But Chico Rodriguez
is an exceptional Fighter.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:38.380
It would be a pity if we were not
able to give him another chance.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.590
Senor Crocket.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.510
We'd like you to have a
Gundam Fight match with him.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:48.640
Sorry, but I'm not interested
in fighting a coward.

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:53.270
There's only one guy I know
who I have to defeat.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:56.050
It's going to be payback time
for what he did to my right arm.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:59.810
Oh, Bunny.

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:01.930
Well. That's terrible.

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:04.690
Bunny says she lost track
of Domon Kasshu.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.240
Hey, Bunny!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.160
I thought I could count on you!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.530
I'm so lucky to have
such a competent crew!

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:12.290
Domon Kasshu?

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.870
Neo Japan's Gundam Fighter.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:18.740
Many of our own men seem
to have gone missing as well!

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:21.340
Chico must be the one behind this!

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:22.380
What's that?!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:28.930
You're one tough guy.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:31.050
I'll put an end to your misery.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:32.470
Adios.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:33.930
Chico, stop!

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.310
Please, Chico. Don't do it!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.480
G-Gina!

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.400
You shouldn't be out of bed.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.610
I can no longer bear to watch you...

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.440
...carry out these awful deeds.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:46.780
No.

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.530
We survive only if we eliminate...

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:50.490
...those who come after us.

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:52.280
So, who's coming after you?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:56.200
I am Domon Kasshu,
Gundam Fighter of Neo Japan.

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.830
You should still be unconscious.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.040
Chico Rodriguez!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.460
I challenge you to a Gundam Fight!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.800
There's no need for that.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.470
M-my body...

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:19.350
The tranquilizer is finally taking effect.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.440
I say good-bye again.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.070
Chico, you must stop.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.530
What are you saying?

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:28.440
I have to do this, or we...

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:29.900
Gina!

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:32.750
Please, Chico...

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:37.750
But we finally managed to get here...

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:39.040
...to this ocean.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:42.060
I mean, that was our dream
all along, wasn't it?

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.260
Mom!

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:50.510
Dad!

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:51.630
Kyoji!

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:53.140
Wait! Kyoji!

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:54.800
Mom's...!

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:01.060
How...
How could this have happened?

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:02.770
I'm sorry.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:05.940
As a personal friend of your dad's
I feel I could've done something.

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:08.400
Otherwise, nothing will change.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:10.950
You will become
a Gundam Fighter...

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:13.030
...and capture your brother Kyoji.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:15.580
Kyoji...!

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:23.750
That's right.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.310
Chico tried to finish me off.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:29.090
Did this girl save me?

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:34.930
Guess Chico must've gone out.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:40.140
Must be nice being
with that beautiful girl.

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:40.770
Rain...

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.730
Are you all right, Domon?

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:45.810
I was caught off guard.
Chico is as fierce as they say.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.940
It's about Chico, but...

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.440
...he became a Gundam Fighter...

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:52.400
...only to escape the Colony
and get to Earth.

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:54.240
If he did that...

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.950
...he should know his Colony
Government would be after him.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:58.370
Hey, Domon...

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.500
...I feel they probably have nothing
to do with the Devil Gundam.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.160
Just let it go.

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:03.920
Rain.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:08.000
He might've come in contact
with the Devil Gundam.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.500
I can't avoid a Gundam Fight.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.260
Yes, I understand all that.
But...

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:13.380
Rain!

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.590
Don't lose sight of our mission!

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.510
I know.

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:21.500
I will follow you.

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:26.360
But to be honest,
I'm getting a bit tired...

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.610
Are you feeling better now?

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:38.070
Thanks for your help.

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:39.240
What a relief.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:41.030
So I take it Chico hasn't returned.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.160
No...

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:44.460
I beg you.

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:46.120
Please don't fight my brother.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.290
Sorry, I can't do that.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.290
But why?

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:52.340
We just want to be left alone
so we can live here quietly.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.840
It's a destiny I cannot avoid!

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:57.740
As a Gundam Fighter,
Chico should know that.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.550
Please.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.180
He's been doing this for me.

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.020
Gina!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.430
There's no need to tell him anything.

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:05.390
Chico!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:08.440
Because my sister wishes it,
I'll spare your life.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:09.940
Now get out of here!

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.320
I won't!

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.940
Be a man for once and fight me!

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.700
If you insist on ending your life!

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.030
Don't do it, Chico!

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:18.610
Don't move!

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.450
Stay back, Gina!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:21.830
Chico...

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:26.040
Gina!

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:28.790
Gina...

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.770
Hang in there, Gina!
Gina!

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:35.010
You should have a doctor
look at her.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.880
If only you hadn't appeared...

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.590
...this wouldn't be happening, Gina.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.720
Rain...
Come in, Rain.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.310
Rain!

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:45.680
Domon?

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.690
Hang in there, Gina.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:50.520
I'll come with you.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:52.690
I owe her my life, you see.

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:01.570
They're out in full force.

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:03.030
We can't make it into town.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.870
What should we do now?

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.150
If we don't get help...

00:10:06.150 --> 00:10:07.080
Chico!

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:10.250
You can bring her to my place.

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.630
What?

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:12.250
You!

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:15.210
It's better if we remain
strangers to each other.

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:18.470
Now...

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.430
We need to find her a doctor.

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.590
That's no problem.

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:23.050
I've made arrangements for that.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.890
You did?

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:27.810
Hi, Domon.

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:29.310
Who the hell are you?

00:10:29.890 --> 00:10:31.100
She's the doctor.

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:31.650
What?

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:33.690
Out you go, gentlemen.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.650
Wait here until I'm finished.

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:38.520
She is a young lady, after all.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.910
Domon, if you peek,
I'll never speak to you again.

00:10:43.570 --> 00:10:44.370
You're nuts!

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.420
So...
You became a Gundam Fighter...

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:50.540
...and then betrayed your country
all for her, right?

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:51.870
Shut up!

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:53.750
Just leave the two of us alone!

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:59.870
Gundam Maxter?

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.430
Chibodee Crocket!

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:04.220
One guy we don't need.

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:05.720
Damn!

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:09.770
This girl is...

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:12.560
So, is the Fighter for this country
a coward?

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:14.060
Why don't you show yourself?!

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:16.940
Come out and fight me,
fair and square!

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:19.690
Are you sure about this?
He's making a spectacle.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:22.780
I've tried to keep this under wraps.

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:24.660
But our situation has now changed.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.080
I won't forgive you.

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:31.120
Coming after me over and over...

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:34.040
Those who get in my way...

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.590
...whoever they are...

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:37.300
...shall die.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:47.390
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:49.520
What's the matter?!

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:51.850
Isn't there a Fighter here
with any guts?!

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:54.690
Shut that big trap of yours...

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:55.690
Stop, Chico!

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:58.780
You want to cause
a commotion here?

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:00.990
Don't get in my way!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:08.330
Domon Kasshu!

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:11.080
What?!
That's the Neo-Japan Fighter!

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.910
He's still alive, as I expected!

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:14.580
It's Chico Rodriguez!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:15.880
Prepare to fire!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:16.630
You're kidding!

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:20.170
Damn, it's a setup!

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:21.420
Fire!

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:26.510
Both of you, this way!

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:27.680
Old man!

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.180
Excellent timing.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.640
The girl disappeared!

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:32.850
Gina!

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.560
After him!
Don't let him escape!

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:36.440
Hey!

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.150
This wasn't the plan!

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:41.650
I thought you wanted to force him
to come back as a Gundam Fighter.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.860
Stay out of our business!

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:45.820
This isn't your country.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.370
Why, you...

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:49.530
This was your plan all along.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:52.950
Where could she have gone
in her weak state?

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:54.830
Gina!

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:55.870
Chico...!

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:57.540
What did you do?!

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:58.790
Where's Gina?! Huh?!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:12:59.960
Where's Gina?!

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:00.880
Chico, stop.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.380
Shut up!

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.760
I'm tired of you coming after us!

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:06.050
Then, fight me.

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:08.970
You really think Gina can be happy
the way things are?

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.100
I know...

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:12.100
But I just have to keep running!

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:13.060
But why?!

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:14.350
Tell me why!

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.480
It's Gina...

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:19.150
She has a virus from the Colony,
right?

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:22.110
I believe they haven't found
a cure for it.

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:26.220
She has maybe another
year or so to live.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.120
This next year...

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:32.330
...I wanted Gina to be able to
live in this land...

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:35.120
...that we'd dreamed about
since childhood.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:38.880
I've had to do whatever I could
to escape my past.

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:39.540
You're wrong!

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:43.380
You fight no matter how cruel
your fate may be.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:45.090
That's a Gundam Fighter!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:48.180
You're just running away.
That's all.

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:49.680
What?!

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:52.570
You'll never understand
how I feel!

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:54.910
You think you're the
only one suffering?

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:56.350
Stop it, you two!

00:13:56.680 --> 00:13:58.650
This is no time to be arguing.

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:00.770
Soldiers are out there.

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:03.400
You'll find it harder
to find your sister.

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:06.110
That's right.
Any ideas on where she went?

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:07.990
She could be headed to our house.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:09.110
Let's go!

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:11.950
Okay! Now!

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:13.990
I appreciate your help.

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:16.120
You take good care of your sister.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:17.710
Yes, thank you.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:24.270
That was Chico Rodriguez!

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:25.670
- Contact headquarters!
- Right!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:28.680
All right.
Maintain pursuit.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:31.680
There should be a Gundam
near where he's headed!

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.310
Where did you go, Chico?

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:48.280
Does Gina know she has
only a year to live?

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:49.610
Yes.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:52.950
But a Gundam Fighter is bound
to continue fighting.

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:55.030
So, in order to be by her side...

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:56.790
...this was all I could do.

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:58.410
But...

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.250
...is Gina all right with that?

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:07.510
Gina!

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:09.760
Come on, Gina!

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.510
She needs treatment.

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.140
Stop right there, Chico Rodriguez.

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:17.770
Return the Tequila Gundam
that you stole.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:21.640
You are under arrest for treason!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.070
Chico...

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:28.110
Just run away.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.340
Don't worry about me.

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:32.110
I won't be around much longer...

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:34.700
Gina...

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:36.240
What will you do, Chico?

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.580
Are you going to leave your sister
and run?

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.040
What?!

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:46.380
Gina...

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:49.070
There's no way I can ever
leave you behind.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:50.510
Chico...

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.220
Gina...

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.140
Stop that man!

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:06.110
Chico...

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.440
He's running away?!

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.360
No. He's going to bring out
his Gundam.

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:15.910
Rain!
We'll do the same!

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:17.370
No, Domon.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.700
Think about Gina!

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:20.750
That's got nothing to do with me.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.040
Domon...

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:23.920
Core Lander!

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:28.250
Rise, Gundam!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:12.950
Mobile Trace System checking
brainwaves, blood pressure...

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:16.980
...pulse, respiration, temperature,
metabolism. All green.

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.210
The Tequila Gundam...

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:47.790
That's where it was!

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:51.340
Call for backup!
Deploy our mobile suits!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:52.750
Chico...

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.420
You said you'd never
get into a Gundam again.

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:57.630
So, you've finally come around!

00:17:57.630 --> 00:18:00.050
I'll grant your wish and fight you.

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.360
I hope you're satisfied.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:06.930
Gina, all I have left in me
is the ability to fight.

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:08.190
Forgive me.

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:17.400
Oh, no!

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:23.080
Still trying to get in our way?!

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:29.870
What's that?

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:31.960
Just a moment!

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:33.670
Hey, Neo Japan!

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.090
I'll be your opponent now!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:37.920
A Gundam Fight is a
one-on-one match!

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.050
Get out of the way!

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:40.590
How ungrateful!

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:42.470
Gundam Fight!

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:46.640
Ready...

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.890
...Go!

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:57.070
Chico...

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:00.990
I win the match, Chico.

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:03.200
It means you'll have to
return to the Colony.

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:05.620
Chico.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.330
Chico, it's all right.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:12.000
I thank you for bringing me to
Earth, even for such a short time!

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.380
Gina...

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:15.710
Domon Kasshu!

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:16.550
What's the matter?!

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:17.880
Finish me off!

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:19.420
Chico...

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:20.970
All right.

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:24.350
Here I go! Shining...

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:27.270
Finger!

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:33.690
Chico!

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:37.110
Domon Kasshu.

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:38.570
Please take care of Gina.

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:41.650
Are you just going to
accept your fate?!

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:43.530
You've got to face it!

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:46.240
You've got to protect Gina!

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:47.330
Why, you...

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:49.330
Live your life with Gina!

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:50.580
What?

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.000
The Fighter could lose his life!

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:57.380
Chico!

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:02.760
Chico!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.310
I've lost respect for you,
Neo Japan.

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:18.940
You didn't have to go that far!
You already won the match!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.190
So, why'd you do it?!

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:23.700
Chico did not die in this match.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:26.740
Only the Gundam Fighter
representing Neo Mexico.

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:28.080
What's that?

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.980
I see!

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:31.700
If he went down as a Fighter...

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:33.750
...no one would come after him.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.810
Good thinking, Neo Japan!

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:41.170
Chico...

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.720
Reporting.

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:48.260
Under the Gundam Fight
International Regulations...

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:51.310
...I submit a notice of casualty
in a Gundam Fight.

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:52.770
Yes.

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:55.140
Chico Rodriguez has lost his life.

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:56.440
Isn't that right?

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:59.230
Chico fought courageously
for his nation...

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:01.320
...and sacrificed his life honorably.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:03.740
I'm sure our Colony
will recognize this.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.280
Men think only of themselves.

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:13.870
Chico...

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:25.380
Gina.

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:29.390
Chico!

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:31.970
You're alive?!
But how?!

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:33.020
Gina...

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:34.890
...we'll always be together.

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:36.770
No more running.

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:38.940
Thanks to that man.

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:39.900
Him?

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:41.730
Thank you.

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:46.820
Gina...

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:51.120
...the ocean is filled with life
just like Grandpa told us long ago.

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:52.870
What do you mean?

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:56.250
When I was sinking into the abyss,
the ocean gave me new life.

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:57.830
You were reborn?

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:59.130
Yes, that's right.

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:04.090
If I disappeared into the ocean,
I would be reborn, too, right?

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:07.050
Yes.

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:10.760
I'm sure. I'm sure that you'll be reborn.

00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:33.660
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:38.040
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:38.330 --> 00:22:42.500
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:46.050
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:46.340 --> 00:22:53.220
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:58.940
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:04.190
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:10.740
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:11.110 --> 00:23:14.870
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:15.030 --> 00:23:20.870
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:33.340 --> 00:23:35.350
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:38.680
In a match against Neo Canada's
Andrew Graham...

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:41.850
...Rain ends up being
taken hostage.

00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:45.440
Domon is headed to the
Rockies to save Rain.

00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:50.030
But Argo's Bolt Gundam presents
a challenge before him.

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.450
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:57.130
An Old Grudge!
Revenge of the Space Police.

00:23:55.280 --> 00:24:02.100
An Old Grudge!
Revenge of the Space Police
